text = "[center]Jerry. Age 34. Former tax accountant.
Fired on a Tuesday.

He found his late grandfather's snowboard in the garage.
He drove to the mountain. He pointed it downhill.

[color=#ff730d]That was three weeks ago. Jerry has not stopped.[/color][/center]"
